{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21814","headline":"有酒十章 八 · 元稹","name":"有酒十章 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有酒有酒兮告临江，风漫漫兮波长。\n渺渺兮注海，海苍苍兮路茫茫。\n彼万流之混入兮，又安能分若畎浍淮河与夫岷吴之巨江。\n味作咸而若一，虽甘淡兮谁谓尔爲良。\n济涓涓而缕贯，将奈何兮万里之浑黄。\n鲸归穴兮渤溢，鳌载山兮低昂。\n阴火然兮衆族沸渭，飓风作兮昼夜猖狂。\n顾千珍与万怪兮，皆委润而深藏。\n信天地之瀦蓄兮，我可奈何兮一杯又进兮包大荒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21814.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21814","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}